{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:10 2026-07-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:10 2026-07-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:10 2026-07-06 HKT</p><p>上環急庇利街8號一海味舖，今日（7月6日）下午3時許店內突然冒煙，消防到場趕至處理。所幸事件中無人受傷，店內鮑參翅肚亦逃過一劫，事後店員清理舖內積水。目前起火原因仍在調查，現場消息指懷疑是電器故障肇禍。</p><img alt=\"事後店員清理舖內積水。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7f542bf44f9920f43db8ab2fa6a099b4/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-06_at_16_37_12.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"事後店員清理舖內積水。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6f6581555e26e439e4e7319fb1aa45a5/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-06_at_16_37_11_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為上環急庇利街8號一海味舖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9d80436ced2d0ad308a10c1a87310c9d/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-06_at_16_37_12_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為上環急庇利街8號一海味舖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c23cf1e0247286e593d9929ffb625e19/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-06_at_16_37_11.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防趕至處理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3386ba0d5b9de2ac7156d7d9d25e592d/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-06_at_16_47_08_0.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-06T09:20:56.054564+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}